#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How often gather data"
msgstr "Kufanele kuqoqwe idatha kangaki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Evidence will gather data periodically. If disabled, you can only view data for specific host"
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, i-Evidence izoqoqa idatha ngezikhathi ezithile. Uma kukhutshaziwe, ungabuka kuphela idatha yomsingathi othile"

#: includes/settings.php
