msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Nsuku zonke"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every week"
msgstr "Njalo ngeviki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When evidence will be started"
msgstr "Ukuthi ubufakazi buzoqalwa nini"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for gather data to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the action would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Isikhathi Esiyisisekelo sokuqoqwa kwedatha okuzokwenzeka.  Isibonelo, uma usebenzisa u-'12:00am' futhi ukhetha kanye ngosuku, isenzo sizoqala cishe phakathi kwamabili nsuku zonke."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How many changes store in database"
